<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Laporan Harian ML</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { 
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6; 
      color: #374151; 
      background: #f3f4f6;
    }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; }
    
    .header { 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af 0%, #3b82f6 100%); 
      color: white; 
      padding: 30px 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
    }
    .header-icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .header p { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; }
    
    .content { padding: 30px 20px; }
    
    .owner-info {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .owner-info h3 {
      color: #111827;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .owner-info p {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    .stats {
      display: table;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .stats-row {
      display: table-row;
    }
    .stat {
      display: table-cell;
      padding: 15px 10px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      text-align: center;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .stat:first-child {
      border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px;
      border-right: none;
    }
    .stat:nth-child(2), .stat:nth-child(3), .stat:nth-child(4) {
      border-right: none;
    }
    .stat:last-child {
      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    }
    .stat-value { 
      font-size: 28px; 
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .stat-value.total { color: #111827; }
    .stat-value.critical { color: #dc2626; }
    .stat-value.severe { color: #ea580c; }
    .stat-value.moderate { color: #d97706; }
    .stat-value.mild { color: #ca8a04; }
    .stat-label { 
      color: #6b7280; 
      font-size: 11px; 
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }
    
    .section {
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    
    .table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .table th, .table td {
      padding: 12px 10px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .table th {
      background: #f9fafb;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #374151;
    }
    .table td {
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .table .count {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
    }
    
    .health-status {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .health-status.healthy {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
    }
    .health-status.degraded {
      background: #fef3c7;
      color: #92400e;
    }
    .health-status.critical {
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
    }
    .health-icon {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
    .health-text {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    .empty-state {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .empty-state-icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .btn { 
      display: inline-block; 
      background: #3b82f6; 
      color: white !important; 
      padding: 14px 32px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    .footer { 
      padding: 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
      font-size: 12px; 
      color: #9ca3af;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .stat {
        display: block;
        border-radius: 0;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        margin-bottom: -1px;
      }
      .stat:first-child {
        border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      }
      .stat:last-child {
        border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-icon">📊</div>
      <h1>Laporan Harian ML</h1>
      <p>Ringkasan aktivitas anomali 24 jam terakhir</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <div class="owner-info">
        <h3>{{ownerName}}</h3>
        <p>{{formatDate reportDate}}</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Ringkasan Anomali</div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stats-row">
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value total">{{totalAnomalies}}</div>
              <div class="stat-label">Total</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value critical">{{criticalCount}}</div>
              <div class="stat-label">Kritis</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value severe">{{severeCount}}</div>
              <div class="stat-label">Parah</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value moderate">{{moderateCount}}</div>
              <div class="stat-label">Sedang</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <div class="stat-value mild">{{mildCount}}</div>
              <div class="stat-label">Ringan</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      {{#ifGt topAnomalousSensors.length 0}}
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Sensor Paling Banyak Anomali</div>
        <table class="table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Device</th>
              <th>Sensor</th>
              <th style="text-align: center;">Jumlah</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each topAnomalousSensors}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{deviceName}}</td>
              <td>{{sensorName}}</td>
              <td class="count">{{count}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      {{else}}
      <div class="empty-state">
        <div class="empty-state-icon">✅</div>
        <p>Tidak ada anomali terdeteksi dalam 24 jam terakhir</p>
      </div>
      {{/ifGt}}
      
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Status Sistem</div>
        {{#ifEq systemHealth "healthy"}}
        <div class="health-status healthy">
          <span class="health-icon">✅</span>
          <span class="health-text">Sistem Berjalan Normal</span>
        </div>
        {{/ifEq}}
        {{#ifEq systemHealth "degraded"}}
        <div class="health-status degraded">
          <span class="health-icon">⚠️</span>
          <span class="health-text">Kinerja Sistem Menurun</span>
        </div>
        {{/ifEq}}
        {{#ifEq systemHealth "critical"}}
        <div class="health-status critical">
          <span class="health-icon">🔴</span>
          <span class="health-text">Sistem Dalam Kondisi Kritis</span>
        </div>
        {{/ifEq}}
      </div>
      
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Buka Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Email ini dikirim otomatis oleh sistem IoT PDAM.</p>
      <p>Untuk berhenti menerima laporan harian, silakan atur di <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}/settings">pengaturan akun</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
